    q: 'Do you treat during service hours?',
    a: 'Not usually, and you would not want us to. Food service work is generally done outside operating hours, which suits the treatment as much as it suits you — surfaces are clear, equipment can be moved, and the crevice work that actually matters is reachable. Where a premises is genuinely twenty-four hour, we plan around the quietest window and the vacant-space provisions in the rules.',
  },
